                    D810044–0751. Confidential. Drafted by Edmund Hull (NEA/AFN); cleared by John
                    Hamilton (NEA/AFN) and for information by Lillian Harris (INR); approved by
                    Flaten. Sent for information to Rabat.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d6-f2" n="2" xml:id="d6-f2-content">
